% The beetle is a green or blue car. Green leads to nice or pretty and each
% of those properties branches twice more. Blue and all eight terminal
% properties entail beauty, so the beetle is beautiful in every case.
% Shows recursive proof by cases over a tree of disjunctive conclusions.
% See https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disjunction_elimination

the templates are:
    *a thing* is a car,
    *a thing* has property *a first property* or *a second property*,
    *a property* entails *a first property* or *a second property*,
    *a property* entails beauty,
    *a property* guarantees beauty,
    *a thing* is beautiful.

the knowledge base beetle cases includes:
beetle is a car.

a car has property green or blue
    if the car is a car.

% Green branches into two families of properties, with four leaves each.
green entails nice or pretty.
pretty entails pretty1 or pretty2.
nice entails nice1 or nice2.
pretty1 entails pretty11 or pretty12.
pretty2 entails pretty21 or pretty22.
nice1 entails nice11 or nice12.
nice2 entails nice21 or nice22.

% Blue and each leaf entail beauty directly.
pretty11 entails beauty.
pretty12 entails beauty.
pretty21 entails beauty.
pretty22 entails beauty.
nice11 entails beauty.
nice12 entails beauty.
nice21 entails beauty.
nice22 entails beauty.
blue entails beauty.

% A guarantee propagates up a fork only when both alternatives have one.
a property guarantees beauty
    if the property entails beauty.

a property guarantees beauty
    if the property entails a first property or a second property
    and the first property guarantees beauty
    and the second property guarantees beauty.

a thing is beautiful
    if the thing has property a first property or a second property
    and the first property guarantees beauty
    and the second property guarantees beauty.

query beautiful is:
    beetle is beautiful.
